ites and saved checklists persisted with correct counts and displays.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-11\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Date validation does not reject past dates\", \"actual\": \"Entered past date Jan 1, 2025 (2025-01-01) when current date is Aug 25, 2026 (2026-08-25). Past date was accepted and saved. Previous date was Jun 15, 2027. Should reject past/current dates and retain previous future date.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-12\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Venue listings display complete details: name (Rosewood Garden Estate), location (Napa Valley, CA), type (Garden), price range (Luxury $$$), rating (4.9), description, and capacity (Up to 200 guests). Each venue also has a \\\"View Details\\\" button for additional information. Vendors similarly display full details in listings.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-13\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Marked checklist task \\\"Set a budget\\\" as completed. Checklist progress immediately updated from 0% to 17% (1 of 6 completed). Dashboard aggregate progress updated from 0% to 9%. Navigated away and back - task remains marked as completed with progress persisting. Unmark and re-mark actions work correctly.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-14\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Tested filtering and search: Venues - filtered by Garden type showing 2 of 8, added price filter (Moderate) showing 1 of 8, cleared filters showing 8 of 8. Vendors - filtered by Photography showing 1 of 10. Search - searched \\\"beach\\\" venues showing 2 of 8, searched \\\"CATERING\\\" vendors showing 1 of 10. All results update immediately without submit button. Clearing criteria restores full list.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-19\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Opened wedding details editor showing saved values (Carol Davis, Jan 1, 2025, $50,000, 150 guests). Changed partner name from \\\"Carol Davis\\\" to \\\"Diana Prince\\\" and clicked Cancel. Change was discarded - dashboard still displays \\\"Carol Davis & Bob Johnson\\\". All previously saved values retained without replacement by cancelled draft.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-15\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Dashboard displays: couple names (Carol Davis & Bob Johnson), formatted date (Jan 1, 2025), budget ($50,000), guest count (150), planning progress (9%), saved checklist counts (2 saved) with previews showing titles and progress (1 of 6, 0 of 5), and favorite counts (1 saved venue, 2 saved vendors) with previews (Sunset Beach Resort, Eternal Moments Photography, Gourmet Celebrations).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-16\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Venues display: name (Rosewood Garden Estate), location (Napa Valley, CA), type (Garden), price (Luxury $$$), rating (4.9), summary description, capacity (Up to 200 guests). Vendors display: name (Eternal Moments Photography), location (Los Angeles, CA), service type (Photography), price (Luxury $$$), rating (4.9), summary, specialties (Candid Shots, Drone Photography, Same-Day Edits).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-17\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Checklists cover all required categories: Planning (12+ Months Before, 8-10 Months Before), Ceremony (Ceremony Planning), Reception (Reception Details), Attire (Wedding Attire), Honeymoon (Honeymoon Planning). Verified \\\"12+ Months Before\\\" checklist contains 6 tasks with titles and explanatory guidance: Set budget, Choose date, Book venue, Start guest list, Hire planner, Book photographer/videographer.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-18\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Tested combined search/filter: Venues - filtered by Garden + Moderate price showed 1 of 8 (Meadow Brook Gardens). Vendors - searched \\\"CATERING\\\" (cas